  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato and potato into bite-sized chunks. Slice the capsicum.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle generously with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic& herb seasoning, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Add a dash of water to tray and roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f422ed75668bdb110ed057/step-7d937297.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain the sweetcorn.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f422ed75668bdb110ed057/step-3ae873e5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook sweetcorn until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a second medium bowl.\n• In a small bowl, combine mild chipotle sauce, the brown sugar and a splash of water. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are “popping” out",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f422ed75668bdb110ed057/step-81ca0a43.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. In a medium bowl, add haloumi, Tex-Mex spice blend and the plain flour, gently toss until well coated.\n• When veggies have 5 minutes remaining, return frying pan to medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove from the heat, then add mild chipotle sauce and a splash of water, tossing until coated.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f422ed75668bdb110ed057/step-16300f96.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, to the bowl with the charred corn, add shredded cabbage mix, a good pinch of salt, sugar and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f422ed75668bdb110ed057/step-b3dc39b5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Tex-Mex haloumi, roasted veggies, charred corn and slaw between bowls.\n• Tear over coriander. Drizzle with plant-based aoili. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f422ed75668bdb110ed057/step-163bc638.jpg"
    }
  ]
